From 1720f9c3385e6add6e74d1326faab42e9808964c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daliborlol <dalibor@pyro.tf>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 13:29:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: support asset-less export of shipped TF2 maps

- --allow-unresolved-patch-includes: report a Patch VMT whose include
  target is not mounted (VBSP cubemap patches) as an unresolved material
  (role patchInclude) instead of failing the whole export.
- --lightmap-styles strict|first|all|N,...: compose faces that store
  several light styles by summing decoded ColorRGBExp32 samples of the
  selected styles (manifest records composedStyles). Default stays strict.
- Export texdata reflectivity as materials[].extras.sourceReflectivity so
  untextured consumers can render compile-time average albedo.
- Treat non-finite displacement blend alphas as 0 (pl_eruption_b15
  DISPINFO 56) and count them in stats.sanitizedDisplacementAlphas;
  non-finite positions still fail closed.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
